DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260910T183000
DURATION:PT2H30M
SUMMARY:Danvers Football vs Concord-Carlisle (W 16–0)
LOCATION:Morse Field at Dr. Deering Stadium\, Danvers
DESCRIPTION:Non-league\nFinal: Danvers 16\, Concord-Carlisle 0\nThree Falco
 ns ran for 100-plus yards and the defense never let Concord-Carlisle run a
  play in Danvers territory. Danvers rolled up 382 yards\, 353 of them on t
 he ground\, and allowed no first downs and just 15 yards of offense in the
  season opener.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org
 /football/schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/football/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:football-2@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260918T190000
DURATION:PT2H30M
SUMMARY:Danvers Football at Melrose (W 17–7)
LOCATION:Fred Green Memorial Stadium\, Melrose
DESCRIPTION:Non-league\nFinal: Danvers 17\, Melrose 7\nZach Fultz scored on
  the opening drive and again with three seconds left in the half\, after M
 elrose had tied it 7–7\, and Colby Medeiros added a 35-yard field goal i
 n the third quarter. The defense held Melrose to 136 yards.\nSchedule and 
 results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/football/schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/football/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:football-3@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260925T180000
DURATION:PT2H30M
SUMMARY:Danvers Football at Reading (W 37–20)
LOCATION:Hollingsworth Field\, Reading
DESCRIPTION:Non-league\nFinal: Danvers 37\, Reading 20\nDanvers trailed 8
 –0 after a quarter and 14–10 at halftime\, then outscored Reading 27
 –6 after the break. The ground game produced five rushing touchdowns: Ja
 ck Houston and Zach Fultz both cleared 100 yards\, and Colby Medeiros adde
 d a 36-yard field goal and an interception in a non-league road win.\nSche
 dule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/football/schedule.ht
 ml
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/football/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
