DURATION:PT2H30M
SUMMARY:Danvers Football vs Beverly (W 38–0)
LOCATION:Morse Field at Dr. Deering Stadium\, Danvers
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 38\, Beverly 0\nIn new 
 all-black uniforms\, Danvers debuted a shotgun double wing. Captain Nate W
 ise threw for a career-high 120 yards and two touchdowns\, both to Jack Ho
 uston\, and the defense forced three fumbles and held Beverly to 38 yards.
 \nSchedule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/football/sched
 ule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/football/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
